ent-NCBorgCore = biopod
    .desc = A physical carrier for one living biological brain. Requires real power, perfusion medium, oxygen, dialysate, coolant and nutrients.

ent-NCBorgStandardShell = standard civilian shell
    .desc = A humanoid civilian frame on a mounting socket. Its real organs, parts, damage and batteries remain with the shell.

ent-NCBorgEmptySocket = empty shell socket
    .desc = An empty mounting carrier for a disconnected physical shell.

ent-NCBorgSupportBottle = biopod support mixture
    .desc = A finite service mixture for the external support reservoir. Nutrients and drugs use the separate injection port.

ent-NCBorgNutrientSyringe = biopod nutrient syringe
    .desc = A finite nutrient dose for the injection port. Assimilation uses the physical artificial metabolism.

